moments-title = Ask once. It takes care of the rest.
moments-lede = This is what you see in the admin, from the first word to the answer.
moment-today-title = You ask, once.
moment-today-text = Aloud in the kitchen, or in a message. Nestor answers at once, and the home screen shows the house as it sees it: who is where, what it needs from you, what it is doing.
moment-today-alt = The admin’s home screen: the house, the occupied rooms, what Nestor waits for and what it is doing now
moment-ongoing-title = It takes care of it.
moment-ongoing-text = Reminders, watches, long tasks: everything it does on its own is on one page, with where it stands. You approve, cancel or stop.
moment-ongoing-alt = The “Ongoing” page: what waits for an answer, tasks, planned reminders and watches
moment-house-title = It finds the right person, in the right place.
moment-house-text = Home Assistant tells who is in which room. Nestor speaks where you are, writes if you are out, and never cuts into a conversation.
moment-house-alt = “The house” page: the people of the household, the rooms and their devices
moment-journal-title = And you always know why.
moment-journal-text = Every word it says is in the household’s journal, with its reason. “Why did it speak to me?” always has an answer.
moment-journal-alt = The journal: a watch firing, the decision and its reason, then the message
